==Trivia==
This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Silver Tempest|Mareanie|114}} from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s {{TCG|Silver Tempest}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier.
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Mareanie|68}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*{{m|Poison Sting}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Mareanie}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

